00:01:34.363 --> 00:01:36.842
Looking forward to smashing
your faces in this weekend.

00:01:36.842 --> 00:01:39.123
Thought the official prediction
comes later in the week,

00:01:39.123 --> 00:01:40.543
and we'll see what that's all about, so.

00:01:40.543 --> 00:01:42.283
Live in New York,

00:01:42.283 --> 00:01:44.123
and some other exciting news.

00:01:44.123 --> 00:01:46.723
India is finally back after being away

00:01:46.723 --> 00:01:48.503
for six and a half months.

00:01:48.503 --> 00:01:49.703
- That was a long trip.
- Yeah, it was a long time.

00:01:49.703 --> 00:01:51.282
- It was a really long trip.

00:01:51.282 --> 00:01:52.062
- It was.

00:01:52.062 --> 00:01:53.803
- Got a pretty rad t-shirt on.

