(bell rings)

00:02:02.523 --> 00:02:03.403
link it up,

00:02:03.403 --> 00:02:04.702
link it in Facebook and YouTube

00:02:04.702 --> 00:02:06.703
and also play this little
clip that happened yesterday

00:02:06.703 --> 00:02:07.803
after the Jets game.

